{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/taj-wellington-mews-bnw-developments-al-marjan-island","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1300,"crm_id":"2450","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Taj Wellington Mews","slug":"taj-wellington-mews-bnw-developments-al-marjan-island","display_address":"Al Marjan Island","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"2028","developer":"BnW Developments","price":1500000,"display_price":"1.5M","lattitude":25.6905144,"longitude":55.7381702,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Taj Wellington Mews by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-bnw-developments/\">BNW Developments</a> is a landmark branded residence on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/al-marjan-island/\">Al Marjan Island</a>, Ras Al Khaimah, redefining luxury coastal living. Designed in collaboration with Taj Hotels, the project seamlessly blends heritage and innovation, offering fully furnished <strong>studios, 1, 2, and 3-bedroom apartments</strong> with breathtaking sea views.</p><p>The twin-tower design rises above a circular podium, creating an architectural statement of modern elegance and refined comfort. Every detail, from the cross-ventilated layouts to the curated interiors, reflects Taj’s timeless commitment to sophistication and well-being.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Taj_Wellington_Mews_by_BNW_Developments_91251410f2.jpg","hash":"Taj_Wellington_Mews_by_BNW_Developments_91251410f2","name":"Taj Wellington Mews by BNW Developments"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Taj_Wellington_Mews_by_BNW_Developments_2f7360c6b9.jpg","hash":"Ta