lopments"},"style":null,"title":"Taj Wellington Mews at Al Marjan Island – Where the Taj Legacy Finds Its Island Home","heading":"Unique Selling Points","bg_color":"blue","image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<ul><li>Branded Excellence by Taj Hotels: A rare opportunity to own a residence under the globally acclaimed Taj brand.</li><li>Iconic Twin-Tower Design: Striking architecture with curved façades and a podium-level landscape.</li><li>Fully Furnished Residences: Elegant interiors styled with Taj’s signature finishes and natural tones.</li><li>Panoramic Waterfront Views: Every home offers uninterrupted views of the Arabian Gulf and Al Marjan skyline.</li><li>Wellness Beyond Compare: Rejuvenate with a Taj-branded spa, Zen meditation pavilion, and serene outdoor spaces.</li><li>Gourmet Living Experience: Savor signature dining, poolside lounges, and open-air cinema nights.</li><li>Luxury with Long-Term Value: High appreciation potential in Ras Al Khaimah’s booming waterfront market.</li><li>Flexible Ownership Plan: Own with a 60/40 payment plan, secure your property with ease and confidence.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1836,"cta":{"id":2634,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Taj_Wellington_Mews_by_BNW_Developments_5af959c126.jpg","hash":"Taj_Wellington_Mews_by_BNW_Developments_5af959c126","name":"Taj Wellington Mews by BNW Developments"},"style":null,"title":"The Heart of Coastal Sophistication","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Situated in Al Marjan Island, a world-class man-made archipelago, Taj Wellington Mews Al Marjan is surrounded by Ras Al Khaimah’s most prestigious hotels, beaches, and entertainment venues. The island blends resort living with investment potential, offering seamless access to Al Hamra Village, RAK City Center, and Dubai via E311. With breathtaking sea views and an ambiance of exclusivity, it’s the perfect address for luxury seekers and investors alike.</p><ul><li>5 Minutes – Wynn Integrated Resort</li><li>10 Minutes – Al Hamra Village</li><li>15 Minutes – RAK City Center</li><li>30 Minutes – RAK International Airport</li><li>60 Minutes – Dubai via E311</li></ul>","design_title":null},"brochure":{"id":4450,"url":"","file":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/brochure_78b0bfe8b0.pdf","hash":"brochure_78b0bfe8b0","name":"brochure"},"item":[],"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/General_Brochure_90d7160d65.png","hash":"General_Brochure_90d7160d65","name":"General"}},"video_module":{"id":3119,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":4220,"url":null,"area":null,"size":"489 – 1,326 sq.ft","media":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Taj_Wellington_Mews_by_BNW_Developments_049efcb0f5.jpg","hash":"Taj_Wellington_Mews_by_BNW_Developments_049efcb0f5","name":"Taj Wellington Mews by BNW Developments"},"title":"Studio Apartments","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":4221,"url":null,"area":null,"size":"955 – 3,077 sq.ft","media":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Taj_Wellington_Mews_by_BNW_Developments_8d6ba685cc.jpg","hash":"Taj_Wellington_Mews_by_BNW_Developments_8d6ba685cc","name":"Taj Wellington Mews by BNW Developments"},"title":"1 Bedroom Apartments","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":4222,"url":null,"area":null,"size":"1,531 – 5,091 sq.ft","media":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Taj_Wellington_Mews_by_BNW_Developments_87c9807cd6.jpg","hash":"Taj_Wellington_Mews_by_BNW_Developments_87c9807cd6","name":"Taj Wellington Mews by BNW Developments"},"title":"2 Bedroom Apartments","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":4223,"url":null,"area":null,"size":"1,985 – 3,833 sq.ft","media":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Taj_Wellington_Mews_by_BNW_Developments_68792576e3.jpg","hash":"Taj_Wellington_Mews_by_BNW_Developments_68792576e3","name":"Taj Wellington Mews by BNW Developments"},"title":"3 Bedroom Apartments","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":4224,"url":null,"area":null,"size":"337 – 14,665 sq.ft","media":null,"title":"Retail Units","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null}],"payment_plan_text":"60/40","payment_plans":[{"id":11866,"title":"10%","description":"On Booking"},{"id":11867,"title":"50%","description":"During Construction"},{"id":11868,"title":"40%","description":"On Handover"}],"community":"Al Marjan Island","publish":1,"currency":"","amenities":[{"id":30198,"url":null,"text":"Open-Air Cinema","type":null,"image":null},{"id":30199,"url":null,"text":"Elite Gym & Fitness Studio","type":null,"image":null},{"id":30200,"url":null,"text":"Exquisite Swimming Pool","type":null,"image":null},{"id":30201,"url":null,"text":"Signature Dining Restaurant","type":null,"image":null},{"id":30202,"url":null,"text":"Wellness Spa & Zen Meditation Pavilion","type":null,"image":null},{"id":30203,"url":null,"text":"Poolside Bar & Lounge","type":null,"image":null},{"id":30204,"url":null,"text":"Private Meeting Lounge","type":null,"image":null},{"id":30205,"url":null,"text":"Landscaped Podium Gardens","type":null,"image":null}],"bitrix":{"id":1341,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Taj Wellington Mews","tower_name":"Taj Wellington Mews","campaign_name":"Taj Wellington Mews","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"BnW Developments","project_location":"Al Marjan Island"},"banner_image_mobile":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Taj_Wellington_Mews_by_BNW_Developments_758b554737.jpg","hash":"Taj_Wellington_Mews_by_BNW_Developments_758b554737","name":"Taj Wellington Mews by BNW Developments"},"seo":{"id":2072,"metaTitle":"Taj Wellington Mews by BNW Developments","canonicalURL":null,"metaDescription":"Discover Taj Wellington Mews by BNW Developments on Al Marjan Island. Fully furnished studio, 1–3 bedroom apartments with sea views, luxury amenities & 60/40 plan."},"more_info":[{"id":8681,"answer":"<p>Taj Wellington Mews is a branded residential development located on Al Marjan Island, Ras Al Khaimah. It is developed by BNW Developments in collaboration with the prestigious Taj Hotels, offering residents a lifestyle that combines world-class hospitality, elegant design, and exceptional coastal living.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is Taj Wellington Mews?"},{"id":8682,"answer":"<p>The project is situated on Al Marjan Island, Ras Al Khaimah, one of the UAE’s most exclusive waterfront destinations, known for its pristine beaches, five-star hotels, and proximity to landmarks such as the Wynn Integrated Resort, Rixos Bab Al Bahr, and Al Hamra Mall.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Where is Taj Wellington Mews located?"},{"id":8683,"answer":"<p>Taj Wellington Mews by BNW Developments features a selection of fully furnished residences, including studio, 1-, 2-, and 3-bedroom apartments, as well as limited retail spaces. Each unit is thoughtfully designed with Taj’s signature finishes, spacious layouts, and stunning sea views.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What types of units are available?"},{"id":8684,"answer":"<p>The starting price for properties at Taj Wellington Mews Al Marjan Island is AED 1.5 Million, making it an attractive option for investors and homeowners seeking branded luxury with long-term value.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is the starting price?"},{"id":8685,"answer":"<p>The project offers a flexible 10/50/40 payment plan, with 10% on booking, 50% spread across construction milestones, and 40% due upon completion. This investor-friendly structure allows buyers to secure their dream home with ease.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is the payment plan for Taj Wellington Mews Al Marjan?"},{"id":8686,"answer":"<p>The handover for Taj Wellington Mews Al Marjan Island is scheduled for Q1 2028, giving investors ample time for phased payments and capital appreciation before delivery.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"When is the handover?"},{"id":8687,"answer":"<p>Residents enjoy access to an array of exclusive Taj-branded amenities, including a wellness spa, Zen meditation pavilion, signature dining restaurant, elite fitness studio, open-air cinema, poolside lounge, and beautifully landscaped podium gardens, all designed to embody the Taj standard of luxury living.</p>","question":"What amenities are available?"}],"virtual_tour_url":null,"permit_number":null,"country":"Ras Al Khaimah","documents":null,"future_launch":null,"adroll":0,"ggfx_results":[{"src_url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Taj_Wellington_Mews_by_BNW_Developments_91251410f2.jpg","src_cftle":"i/Taj_Wellington_Mews_by_BNW_Developments_91251410f2.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/340x252/Taj_Wellington_Mews_by_BNW_Developments_91251410f2.webp","alias":"images","format":"webp","transform":"340x252","created_at":"2025-10-09 12:01:52.531","updated_at":"2025-10-09 12:01:52.531"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/464x312/Taj_Wellington_Mews_by_BNW_Developments_91251410f2.webp","alias":"images","format":"webp","transform":"464x312","created_at":"2025-10-09 12:01:52.531","updated_at":"2025-10-09 12:01:52.531"}]},{"src_url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Taj_Wellington_Mews_by_BNW_Developments_c7ebfb0e05.jpg","src_cftle":"i/Taj_Wellington_Mews_by_BNW_Developments_c7ebfb0e05.jpg","transform